    "/projects/{projectId}/forms/_query": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Form"
        ],
        "summary": "List Forms",
        "description": "To get forms by query for a given project.\n\nCaller can narrow down the results by defining filters in the Query. **operator** can be any of the following values\n\n+ EQ - Equal To\n\n+ LT - Less Than\n\n+ GT - Greater Than\n\n+ LTEQ - Less Than or Equal To\n\n+ GTEQ - Greater Than or Equal To\n\n+ NE - Not Equal To\n\n+ LIKE - Contains\n\n+ OVERLAPS - Polygon Intersection Query\n\n+ EXISTS - Field has a value\n\n+ NOTEXISTS - Field do not have a value\n\n**order** can be any of the following values\n\n+ Ascending\n\n+ Descending\n\n**fields** can be specified if caller wants to retrieve only specific fields as part of response. If fields is null then response will have all the fields otherwise only specified fields will be sent as part of response.\n\nIf your results exceeds the PageSize then **scrollId** can be used to retrieve next set of results.\n\nBoth metadata and property fields can be used to query forms. Also, tags can be added in a form. So that forms can be retrieved by tags.",
        "operationId": "ListForms",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "projectId",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "ID of a Project",
            "required": true,
            "style": "simple",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "example": "Tc_m088b3hk"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "includeSchema",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Set true if schema needs to be sent as part of response Otherwise false.",
            "style": "form",
            "explode": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "example": false
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "pageSize",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Represents Maximum forms a response can have",
            "required": true,
            "style": "form",
            "explode": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "format": "int32",
              "example": 2
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "description": "",
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ListFormsrequest"
              },
              "example": {
                "filter": [
                  {
                    "or": [
                      {
                        "operator": "EQ",
                        "field": "metadata.collection_collectedBy",
                        "operand": "H4ljlocVSgY"
                      },
                      {
                        "operator": "EQ",
                        "field": "metadata.collection_updatedBy",
                        "operand": "H4ljlocVSgY"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "",
            "headers": {},
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ListFormsresponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "deprecated": false
      }
    },
