    {
      "name": "Support",
      "description": "APIs related to Processing Jobs"
    },
    {
      "name": "Companies",
      "description": "APIs related to Company"
    },
    {
      "name": "Form",
      "description": "Followings are the base URLs to access the Form APIs from different environments. The caller has to pick an appropriate base URL based on the location of the project.\n\n+ Staging \n     + North America - https://maps.stage.connect.trimble.com/api\n     + Asia - https://maps31.stage.connect.trimble.com/api\n\n+ Production \n     + North America - https://maps.connect.trimble.com/api\n     + Europe - https://maps21.connect.trimble.com/api\n     + Asia - https://maps31.connect.trimble.com/api\n\nThe following APIs helps to view forms. Form helps to collect/store/retrieve survey data, generating customizable reports and dynamic filters that allow you to narrow results on selected criteria to facilitate analysis.\n\nAPIs will throw HTTP Authorization failure status if caller tries to access a form under a project where he do not have proper access."
    },
    {
      "name": "Form Export",
      "description": "Followings are the base URLs to access the Form Export APIs from different environments. The caller has to pick an appropriate base URL based on the location of the project.\n\n+ Staging\n     + North America - https://maps.stage.connect.trimble.com/api\n     + Asia - https://maps31.stage.connect.trimble.com/api\n\n+ Production \n     + North America - https://maps.connect.trimble.com/api\n     + Europe - https://maps21.connect.trimble.com/api\n     + Asia - https://maps31.connect.trimble.com/api\n\nThe following APIs helps to create/update/delete export jobs. So that forms can be exported in different formats like CSV, GDB, SHP and KML.\n\nAPIs will throw HTTP Authorization failure status if caller tries to access a job under a project where he do not have proper access."
    },
    {
      "name": "Purge",
      "description": "APIs related to Purge are described in this section"
    },
    {
      "name": "Project and User Settings",
      "description": "APIs related to settings are described in this section\n TC supports project settings which will allow user to modify sync,unit and notifications. User settings will allow user to modify viewer settings."
    },
    {
      "name": "Sync",
      "description": "APIs related to Sync Tool are described in this section"
    },
    {
      "name": "Template",
      "description": "Followings are the base URLs to access the Template APIs from different environments. The caller has to pick an appropriate base URL based on the location of the project.\n\n+ Staging\n     + North America - https://maps.stage.connect.trimble.com/api\n     + Asia - https://maps31.stage.connect.trimble.com/api\n\n+ Production \n     + North America - https://maps.connect.trimble.com/api\n     + Europe - https://maps21.connect.trimble.com/api\n     + Asia - https://maps31.connect.trimble.com/api\n\nThe following APIs helps to create/update/delete/view templates and also to publish. So, that forms can be collected from client like Terraflex.\n\nAPIs will throw HTTP Authorization failure status if caller tries to access a template under a project where he do not have proper access."
    },
    {
      "name": "Spatial Workspace",
      "description": "Followings are the base URLs to access the Workspace APIs from different environments. The caller has to pick an appropriate base URL based on the location of the project.\n\n+ Staging\n     + North America - https://maps.stage.connect.trimble.com/api\n     + Asia - https://maps31.stage.connect.trimble.com/api\n\n+ Production \n     + North America - https://maps.connect.trimble.com/api\n     + Europe - https://maps21.connect.trimble.com/api\n     + Asia - https://maps31.connect.trimble.com/api\n\nThe following APIs help to view workspace.\n\n**BackgroundType** can be any of the following values\n\n+ TrimbleStreet\n\n+ TrimbleSatellite\n\nThe Following APIs will throw HTTP Authorization failure status if caller tries to access a workspace under a project where he do not have proper access."
    }
  ]
}